    "添加设备": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add Device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添加一台装了 Claude Code 的 Linux 设备，经 SSH 在上面开对话。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add a Linux device with Claude Code installed and chat with it over SSH."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "添加这台设备": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add This Device"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "停止": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未知": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unknown"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先把设置里 Zeta 的公钥加进那台设备的 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys。设备要是 arm64 或 x86-64 的 Linux，装着 bash 和 Claude Code。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First add Zeta’s public key from Settings to ~/.ssh/authorized_keys on the device. The device must be arm64 or x86-64 Linux with bash and Claude Code installed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "先聊聊": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chat First"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新对话": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "New Conversation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选一个对话": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick a Conversation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用户@主机[:端口]": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "user@host[:port]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "允许": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "允许 %@？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow %@?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "载入更早的消息": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Load Earlier Messages"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找到了": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Found"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这一种请在桌面版或手机版上处理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Handle this one in the desktop or Android app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在打开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Opening"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在回答": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Answering"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "正在思考": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thinking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只是 Zeta 不再连它，那边的会话记录不动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zeta just stops connecting to it. Session history there stays untouched."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "置顶": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pinned"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主机名": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hostname"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主机指纹": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Host Fingerprint"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "总是允许": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always Allow"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "MCP 服务器在等你填写或打开网页": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An MCP server is waiting for a form or a web page"
