    },
    "会话记录连同 Claude Code 存的东西一起删掉，不能恢复。正在进行的对话删不了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The session record and everything Claude Code stored for it will be deleted. This can’t be undone. Conversations in progress can’t be deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "结束 Claude Code 进程，对话内容留着，下次发消息时接上。别处运行的也会被结束，不管那边闲不闲。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ends the Claude Code process. The conversation is kept and resumes when you send the next message. Sessions running elsewhere are ended too, busy or not."
          }
        }
      }
    },
